        "filename": "Mårup kirke - nedtaget.JPG",
        "caption": "Walls of Mårup Church in Lønstrup, Denmark, after the church was dismantled to prevent its loss into the North Sea. Seen from the north. The graveyard adjacent to the church includes several victims from the British frigate, the Crescent, which sank in December 1808. The Crescent's anchor can be seen behind the wooden bell tower at left.",
